@startuml
[*] --> InitialState

 initialState: Initial State

 dashboardView: Dashboard View

 widgetAddition: Widget Addition

 widgetRemoval: Widget Removal

 layoutCustomization: Layout Customization

 thirdPartyIntegration: Third-Party Integration

 searchFunctionality: Search Functionality

 [*] <-- FinalState

 InitialState --> dashboardView : Enter Dashboard

 dashboardView --> widgetAddition : Add Widget

 widgetAddition --> dashboardView : Widget Added

 dashboardView --> widgetRemoval : Remove Widget

 widgetRemoval --> dashboardView : Widget Removed

 dashboardView --> layoutCustomization : Customize Layout

 layoutCustomization --> dashboardView : Layout Updated

 dashboardView --> thirdPartyIntegration : Integrate Third-Party

 thirdPartyIntegration --> dashboardView : Integration Complete

 dashboardView --> searchFunctionality : Search Elements

 searchFunctionality --> dashboardView : Search Complete

 dashboardView --> [*] : Exit Dashboard
@enduml
